<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Judges' Remuneration (Amendment) Act 2005."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@> .
