<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act is deemed to have come into operation on 21 March 2005. Amendment of section 1A"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@> .
