<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Judges' Remuneration Act 1971 [Act 45], which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended in section 1A in the definition of \"retirement\" by substituting for paragraph (a) the following paragraph: \"(a) retirement from the office of a Judge under section 8(a);\". Amendment of section 8"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@> .
