<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/name> "Section 8 of the principal Act is amended—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@> .
