<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@/~cl_3__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for paragraph (a) the following paragraph: “(a) retires from the office of a Judge on attaining the age of sixty-six years or such later time, not being later than six months after he attains that age pursuant to Clause (1) of Article 125 of the Federal Constitution;\"; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@> .
