<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purpose of paragraph 8fd) of the principal Act, the reference to the age of sixty-five years shall continue to apply to a Judge referred to in subsection (1) as if the principal Act had not been amended by this Act. Validation of grant of pension and other benefits"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@/~cl_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@/~cl_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@> .
