<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Pension and other benefits granted to a Judge for the period he held the office after attaining the age of sixty-five years pursuant to Clause (1) of Article 125 of the Federal Constitution before 21 March 2005, shall be deemed to have been validly granted."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/25/eng@> .
